  "1999922840": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1177687115,
   "children": [
    278102615
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "A toast to us. I think we make a pretty good team.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1536517563": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1177687115,
   "children": [
    494411879
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "To Sofia. The best cop in Peak City.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1495397251": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1177687115,
   "children": [
    392786976
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "To whatever happens after we finish the wine!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "278102615": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1999922840,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Oh, I agree. Ever thought about going to the academy? We could use someone like you.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "494411879": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1536517563,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "You really think so? ... I... I'm bad with compliments...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "392786976": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1495397251,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Oh? Confident, aren’t you? Well, let’s see how much charm you’ve got left by the time we’re through with this bottle.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "887566220": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1667439346,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "I have to say, you… you surprised me. In more ways than one",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-116438471": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": 1667439346,
   "children": [
    97474880,
    424782056,
    1700479143
   ],
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "So tell me… what’s next for you? Going to play the hero for someone else?",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "97474880": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -116438471,
   "children": [
    1543077154
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Maybe. I don't know.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1543077154": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 97474880,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "That's... Yeah. I think a long, nice vacation is in order.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "424782056": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -116438471,
   "children": [
    1536014207
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "I think I'm good for a while.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1536014207": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 424782056,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Yeah... Same...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1700479143": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -116438471,
   "children": [
    -376658978
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Well, there's this strong policewoman I'm targeting.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-376658978": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1700479143,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Oh, is that so? Hahaha...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-2098456055": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1667439346,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Oh shit! I need to give my boss a heads-up that I'm calling in vacation. Hopefully we can catch up again?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "67509846": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1739544445,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "It’s… refreshing. And, if I’m being honest… a little tempting.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "292816953": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1739544445,
   "children": [
    -595091072,
    -1408275391,
    2046449852
   ],
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "So, what’s your deal? You come across as this brave, reckless type… but I get the feeling there’s more to you than that.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-595091072": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 292816953,
   "children": [
    1504214207
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "There’s a lot more, but I don’t show it to just anyone.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1504214207": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -595091072,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "I’d like to see it someday. No rush… just know I’m interested.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1408275391": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 292816953,
   "children": [
    -1731398231
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "And what about you? A fearless detective with a hidden soft side?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1731398231": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1408275391,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "I have my moments. But you’ve probably already... seen more of them than most people.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2046449852": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 292816953,
   "children": [
    40659051
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You’ll have to get closer if you want to find out.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "40659051": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 2046449852,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "Oh, I plan to.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-68073143": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1739544445,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I’m glad you came tonight. I needed this… more than I realized.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1262776595": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1739544445,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "I...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1647308626": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1739544445,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Oh, fuck. Come on... I'm sorry, {PC}... Work's calling... Gotta answer...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
